# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.

# Site forms (/contact-us and the sitewide "Get a Quote" panel) need no env
# vars. They POST from the browser to php-mailer/send.php, which runs on a
# separate PHP host (Vercel can't run PHP). Its URL is set in
# lib/enquiry-endpoint.ts, and its SMTP/recipient settings are in
# php-mailer/config.php (see php-mailer/README.md).
